                <pb facs="0630" n="624" sameAs="frus:frus1894app2/pg624"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Lee to Wyllie, July 5, 1854</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Private.]</seg></opener>
                <p>The treaty should be concluded at once, so that we may be prepared for <hi
                        rendition="#italic">emergeneies</hi>. but I agree with you about the final
                    ratification.</p>
            </div>
